==Strategy==
This stage functions on a time limit and has enemies that get stronger the more you kill them, and you gain points based on Production cost x Points multiplier. Bring as many anti-Darks to kill them for the most amount of event points. [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza]] and [[Jetpack Cat (Rare Cat)|Jetpack]] are obvious choices, but use anything that can kill in a quick time and is fairly pricey for maximum points like [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], [[Sanada Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Yukimura]] or [[Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare Cat)|Ultra Kasa Jizo]], who can be used as a supplement or replacement for Pizza Cat.

The goal of this stage isn't to win, but to kill as much as possible with the most expensive units, so do that.

